DesignCraft is an open source page layout and publishing application, a
clean-room reimplementation of the Adobe InDesign workflow written in
pure Rust by the ArtCraft team.  It has spreads and parent pages,
threaded text frames, paragraph and character styles, swatches, text
wrap and a Knuth-Plass paragraph composer, imports and exports IDML, and
exports PNG and PDF (PDF/X-4, PDF/A-2b).

The designcraft-cli tool renders and runs the same engine commands from
scripts, and serves them over MCP for agents.
